(Alumina) 
<br><br>

Fatal Fall of Person Accident <br>
April 18, 2007 
<br><br>

Parish Abatement Co.<br>
Contractor ID No. M390<br>
at<br>
Almatis Inc. <br>
Arkansas Operations Mill <br>
Bauxite, Saline County, Arkansas <br>
